  "description": "Fast, steep, messy, or long, the Twostroke 01 TWO laps up the dirt. Built around the same 01 Premium Carbon frame developed through BMC’s XC racing heritage, this carbon mountain bike makes every pedal stroke count. With modern XC geometry, the steep seattube angle gives more traction on the toughest grades, whilst the longer reach and fork trail makes the bike confident at speed on the roughest terrain.\nUp front, the dependable Rockshock Judy Silver Turnkey suspension keeps things simple and dependable. The drivetrain is Shimano’s latest Deore groupset for efficient power transfer, shifting, and braking. The build rounds out with our SHL280S wheelset, ready for reliable riding in the dirt.\nVersatile by design, run it with a 100 mm fork for pure XC, or push it to 120 mm for more capabilities over unknown terrain.",
